                                                "sense_id": "cbb106b6-6adf-3d3f-9a1b-61bca1e7330d",
                                                "text": "Blocking undercuts out with bonded flowable composite is an option, but the time involved doing a buildup, plus the additional complication to provisionalize, make this option less desirable (Figure 6.19e)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
